- Fixed: changes made on the camera - aperture, ISO, shutter - now reach the app promptly instead of lagging or never arriving.
- Fixed: connecting a second body no longer changes its settings, and pickers only offer what your camera supports.
- Fixed: a dropped cable or a power cycle no longer wedges the app; you keep the last frame and get Retry.
- Clean view is genuinely clean, with a per-tool pin if you want one tool kept on it.
- Focus dial now works in video too, off by default.
